			"size": [
				460.0,
				210.0
			],
			"text": "06 — Physics: Rigid Bodies\n\nA red box and blue sphere fall under gravity, bouncing\noff a static ground plane. PhysicsCHOP reads back live\nposition, rotation, and velocity channels from rigid1.\n\nSOP + MAT → GeometryCOMP → RigidBodyCOMP / StaticBodyCOMP\n→ MergeCOMP → RenderTOP with Camera and Light.\n\nDemonstrates Jolt physics, COMP operators, and 3D rendering.",
			"type": "note"
		}
	],
